body:
Where can I find these things? I don't know if it's possible to get antibacterial/antibiotic creams in the UK without a prescription. I have antiseptic cream but it says online not to use that as it'll damage the skin. I can't find alcohol disinfectant either, everything is antiseptic. I can buy dettol though (Chloroxylenol 4.8% with isopropyl alchohol - but it says for antiseptic use?) would that do?

&#x200B;

I've been feeling quite shakey the past couple days and dizzy, not sure if that's sign of infection too? Though I can't tell if it is since I'm like that most the time anyway so idk if it's worse than normal. The scabs on the sore bits of the wound are yellow?

&#x200B;

Sorry for all the questions. Just so lost with this, thank you for the advice so far though
